    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Covenant Confirmed",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses, \"Come up to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", you and Aaron, Nadab and Abihu, and seventy of the elders of Israel. You are to worship at a distance,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but Moses alone is to approach the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; the others must not come near. And the people may not come up with him.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Moses went and told the people all the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s words and laws, they responded with one voice, \"Everything the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has said we will do.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses then wrote down everything the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "had said.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "EXO 24:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "He got up early the next morning and built an altar at the foot of the mountain and set up twelve stone pillars representing the twelve tribes of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he sent young Israelite men, and they offered burnt offerings and sacrificed young bulls as fellowship offerings to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses took half of the blood and put it in bowls, and the other half he splashed against the altar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he took the Book of the Covenant and read it to the people. They responded, \"We will do everything the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has said; we will obey.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses then took the blood, sprinkled it on the people and said, \"This is the blood of the covenant that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has made with you in accordance with all these words.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses and Aaron, Nadab and Abihu, and the seventy elders of Israel went up",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and saw the God of Israel. Under his feet was something like a pavement made of lapis lazuli, as bright blue as the sky.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But God did not raise his hand against these leaders of the Israelites; they saw God, and they ate and drank.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to Moses, \"Come up to me on the mountain and stay here, and I will give you the tablets of stone with the law and commandments I have written for their instruction.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses set out with Joshua his aide, and Moses went up on the mountain of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said to the elders, \"Wait here for us until we come back to you. Aaron and Hur are with you, and anyone involved in a dispute can go to them.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Moses went up on the mountain, the cloud covered it,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the glory of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "settled on Mount Sinai. For six days the cloud covered the mountain, and on the seventh day the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "called to Moses from within the cloud.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To the Israelites the glory of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.24.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.24.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "looked like a consuming fire on top of the mountain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Moses entered the cloud as he went on up the mountain. And he stayed on the mountain forty days and forty nights.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
